@startuml
!include ../themes/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
' SPEC: _spec/_plans/chess-user-journey.puml
' purpose: enter → play → result is already specified per product
' status: OUTDATED — shipped paths; do not mix Coach and StarChess
' covers: apps/starchess/src/screens/MenuRoute.tsx
'         apps/starchess/src/screens/SingleScreen.tsx
' live spec: _spec/apps/starchess/menu-flow.puml
'            _spec/apps/chess/state-machine.puml
' remaining verb on this path .......... _spec/_plans/forfeit-as-loss.puml
' Notes are capped at 5 lines x 50 columns; one idea per anchor.
title OUTDATED — StarChess path is menu-flow.puml;\norphan-screen work is not a new app

component "Menu → NewGamePanel\n→ /single" as IN <<app>>
component "MatchResultModal\nwin · loss · draw" as END <<app>>
component "ExitGameConfirm\nstill a void" as LEAVE <<error>>
component "**orphan screen**" as ORPH <<error>>

IN ARROW_MAIN END
END ARROW_OPTIONAL IN : Another Game
LEAVE ARROW_ERROR IN : today drops progress
ORPH ARROW_ERROR IN : live path has edges

note bottom of IN
  **""menu-flow.puml"" already lists
  map · team · opponent · rematch ·
  replay.** Coach screens live under
  ""apps/chess"" state-machine. This file
  does not own either.
end note

note right of LEAVE
  **The missing verb is leave-as-loss,
  not a journey rewrite.** See
  forfeit-as-loss.puml.
end note

legend bottom
  **Do not implement this file.**
  ==
  Open the live spec for the product
  you are changing. Do not restyle
  primitives to paper over leave.
end legend
@enduml
